  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "sol.ahsme-1950-p4.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Factoring the numerators and denominator gives \\[ \\begin{aligned} &\\frac{a^2-b^2}{ab} -\\frac{ab-b^2}{ab-a^2}\\\\ &=\\left(\\frac{a}{b}-\\frac{b}{a}\\right)\\\\ &\\quad-\\frac{b(a-b)}{a(b-a)}\\\\ &=\\frac{a}{b}-\\frac{b}{a} +\\frac{b}{a}\\\\ &=\\frac{a}{b}. \\end{aligned} \\]\n\nThus, the correct answer is A.",
      "hints": [
        "Factor \\(a^2-b^2,\\) \\(ab-b^2,\\) and \\(ab-a^2\\)",
        "The second fraction simplifies to \\(-\\frac{b}{a}\\)"
      ],
      "images": []
    }
  ],
